#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:1
msgid "Manage business invoices"
msgstr "Gestiona factures de negoci"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:3
msgid ""
"Record the invoices your business issues and receives: the money a "
"customer owes you and the money you owe a supplier. This guide covers "
"both kinds and shows which records feed your tax calculations."
msgstr ""
"Registra les factures que el teu negoci emet i rep: els diners que et deu"
" un client i els diners que deus a un proveïdor. Aquesta guia tracta els "
"dos tipus i mostra quins registres nodreixen els teus càlculs tributaris."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:7
msgid ""
"A business invoice is not the same as a purchase receipt you attach as "
"evidence. Receipts support a deductible expense on a ledger transaction "
"(see [Attach invoices and receipts](ledger-evidence.md)). Business "
"invoices recorded here are the commercial documents themselves: an "
"*issued* invoice (you billed a customer) or a *received* invoice (a "
"supplier billed you)."
msgstr ""
"Una factura de negoci no és el mateix que un rebut de compra que adjuntes"
" com a prova. Els rebuts justifiquen una despesa deduïble en una "
"transacció del ledger (consulta [Adjunta factures i rebuts](ledger-"
"evidence.md)). Les factures de negoci que es registren aquí són els "
"documents comercials mateixos: una factura *emesa* (has facturat a un "
"client) o una factura *rebuda* (un proveïdor t'ha facturat)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:13
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Abans de començar"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:15
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "Necessites:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:17
msgid ""
"An active taxpayer profile. Every command on this page works on the "
"active profile; if none is set, the command refuses. See [Set up your "
"taxpayer profile](profile-setup.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un perfil de contribuent actiu. Totes les ordres d'aquesta pàgina "
"treballen sobre el perfil actiu; si no n'hi ha cap de definit, l'ordre es"
" nega a continuar. Consulta [Configura el teu perfil de contribuent"
"](profile-setup.md)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:20
msgid ""
"Your passphrase. The tool prompts for it the first time it opens your "
"encrypted storage in a session."
msgstr ""
"La teva frase de contrasenya. L'eina te la demana el primer cop que obre "
"el teu magatzem xifrat en una sessió."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:23
msgid ""
"The examples in this documentation are recorded in English. `aeat` prints"
" its messages in Spanish unless you [choose another language](profile-"
"setup.md#choose-the-output-language)."
msgstr ""
"Els exemples d'aquesta documentació estan enregistrats en anglès. `aeat` "
"mostra els seus missatges en espanyol tret que [triïs un altre idioma"
"](profile-setup.md#choose-the-output-language)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:27
msgid "One invoice catalogue"
msgstr "Un sol catàleg de factures"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:29
msgid ""
"Cadrumo keeps business invoices in one catalogue (`aeat app ledger "
"invoice ...`): a record of who owes you and whom you owe. Use it to "
"record, list, and edit invoices."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo desa les factures de negoci en un sol catàleg (`aeat app ledger "
"invoice ...`): un registre de qui et deu i a qui deus. Fes-lo servir per "
"registrar, llistar i editar factures."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:33
msgid ""
"Every invoice you record is linkable and calculable. Match it to a bank "
"transaction with `aeat app ledger link`, and a calculation reads it "
"directly - for example the Modelo 349 recapitulative declaration of "
"intra-community operations."
msgstr ""
"Cada factura que registres es pot vincular i calcular. Fes-la coincidir "
"amb una transacció bancària amb `aeat app ledger link`, i un càlcul la "
"llegeix directament: per exemple, el Modelo 349, declaració "
"recapitulativa d'operacions intracomunitàries."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:38
msgid ""
"Record every invoice with `invoice add`. There is no second copy to "
"create."
msgstr "Registra cada factura amb `invoice add`. No cal crear-ne cap segona còpia."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:40
msgid ""
"`invoice add` requires `--kind issued` or `--kind received`, and `invoice"
" list` accepts it as a filter. *Issued* means a customer owes you; "
"*received* means you owe a supplier. `invoice view`, `update`, and "
"`remove` take only the invoice id. `invoice add` also requires "
"`--country-code`, the counterparty's two-letter country code."
msgstr ""
"`invoice add` requereix `--kind issued` o `--kind received`, i `invoice "
"list` l'accepta com a filtre. *Emesa* vol dir que un client et deu; "
"*rebuda* vol dir que deus a un proveïdor. `invoice view`, `update` i "
"`remove` només prenen l'id de la factura. `invoice add` també requereix "
"`--country-code`, el codi de país de dues lletres de la contrapart."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:46
msgid "Record an issued invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura emesa"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:48
msgid ""
"Record an invoice you sent to a customer. The command returns the new "
"`invoice_id`, the computed totals, and the values you entered:"
msgstr ""
"Registra una factura que has enviat a un client. L'ordre retorna el nou "
"`invoice_id`, els totals calculats i els valors que has introduït:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:55
msgid ""
"Record the `invoice_id`; you address the invoice by it (or by an "
"unambiguous prefix)."
msgstr ""
"Anota l'`invoice_id`; amb ell (o amb un prefix inequívoc) indiques de "
"quina factura parles."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:58
msgid "Record a received invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura rebuda"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:60
msgid "Record an invoice a supplier sent you. Its `kind` reads `received`:"
msgstr ""
"Registra una factura que t'ha enviat un proveïdor. El seu `kind` és "
"`received`:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:66
msgid "List, view, update, and remove"
msgstr "Llista, consulta, actualitza i elimina"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:68
msgid ""
"List both kinds or filter to one, add a note to a stored invoice, then "
"remove it. The view of one invoice takes its id (or an unambiguous "
"prefix):"
msgstr ""
"Llista els dos tipus o filtra'n només un, afegeix una nota a una factura "
"desada i, tot seguit, elimina-la. La consulta d'una factura pren el seu "
"id (o un prefix inequívoc):"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:75
msgid "Record an intra-community invoice"
msgstr "Registra una factura intracomunitària"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:77
msgid ""
"A supply to, or acquisition from, a VAT-registered business in another EU"
" country is an intra-community operation. Record it on the issued or "
"received invoice with the counterparty's country and EU VAT id, plus the "
"Modelo 349 operation type:"
msgstr ""
"Un lliurament a una empresa d'un altre país de la UE registrada a efectes"
" d'IVA, o una adquisició a aquesta empresa, és una operació "
"intracomunitària. Registra-la a la factura emesa o rebuda amb el país de "
"la contrapart i el seu NIF-IVA de la UE, més el tipus d'operació del "
"Modelo 349:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:86
msgid ""
"`--operation-type` takes one M349 operation key: `E` supplies of goods, "
"`M` supplies after an exempt import, `H` the same via a fiscal "
"representative, `A` acquisitions of goods, `T` triangular supplies, `S` "
"services supplied, `I` services acquired, and the call-off-stock keys `R`"
" (transfers), `D` (returns), and `C` (substitutions)."
msgstr ""
"`--operation-type` pren una clau d'operació del M349: `E` lliuraments de "
"béns, `M` lliuraments després d'una importació exempta, `H` el mateix a "
"través d'un representant fiscal, `A` adquisicions de béns, `T` "
"lliuraments triangulars, `S` serveis prestats, `I` serveis adquirits, i "
"les claus d'existències de reserva (call-off stock) `R` (transferències),"
" `D` (devolucions) i `C` (substitucions)."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:92
msgid ""
"`invoice update` corrects the note, counterparty name and country, "
"operation type and date, IVA category, retention, invoice class, series, "
"and the rectified invoice number. To correct the invoice number, date, "
"tax id, currency, or totals, remove the invoice and record it again."
msgstr ""
"`invoice update` corregeix la nota, el nom i el país de la contrapart, el"
" tipus i la data de l'operació, la categoria d'IVA, la retenció, la "
"classe de factura, la sèrie i el número de la factura rectificada. Per "
"corregir el número de la factura, la data, el NIF, la moneda o els "
"totals, elimina la factura i torna-la a registrar."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:97
msgid "Feed a calculation from the catalogue"
msgstr "Alimenta un càlcul des del catàleg"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:99
msgid ""
"Every invoice in the catalogue reaches a modelo calculation and can be "
"linked to a bank transaction. The sequence records an intra-community "
"supply, lists and inspects the catalogue, then creates and calculates the"
" Modelo 349 recapitulative declaration for the period the invoice falls "
"in:"
msgstr ""
"Totes les factures del catàleg arriben al càlcul d'un modelo i es poden "
"vincular a una transacció bancària. La seqüència registra un lliurament "
"intracomunitari, llista i inspecciona el catàleg i, després, crea i "
"calcula la declaració recapitulativa del Modelo 349 per al període en què"
" cau la factura:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:108
msgid ""
"For an intra-community operation, pass `--operation-type` so the invoice "
"carries the classification the Modelo 349 calculation reads. Use `E`, "
"`H`, `M`, `S`, `T`, `R`, `D`, or `C` for issued catalogue invoices. Use "
"`A`, `I`, or `T` for received catalogue invoices. In Modelo 349, `R` is "
"the call-off-stock transfer key; rectification rows use separate "
"rectified-period and base fields."
msgstr ""
"Per a una operació intracomunitària, passa `--operation-type` perquè la "
"factura porti la classificació que llegeix el càlcul del Modelo 349. "
"Utilitza `E`, `H`, `M`, `S`, `T`, `R`, `D` o `C` per a les factures "
"emeses del catàleg. Utilitza `A`, `I` o `T` per a les factures rebudes "
"del catàleg. Al Modelo 349, `R` és la clau de transferència d'existències"
" de reserva; les files de rectificació utilitzen camps separats de "
"període rectificat i de base."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:114
msgid ""
"An invoice is counted in the period of the date you record with "
"`--operation-date`, so record the devengo date that LIVA art. 75 sets. "
"For an intra-community supply of goods, that is the 15th of the month "
"after the transport starts, or the invoice date if it is earlier (art. "
"75.Uno.8.º). Without `--operation-date`, the invoice date stands in for "
"it. Modelo 349 reads invoices strictly by that date, with no carry-"
"forward from earlier periods."
msgstr ""
"Una factura es compta al període de la data que registres amb "
"`--operation-date`; per això, registra la data de devengo que fixa l'art."
" 75 de la LIVA. En un lliurament intracomunitari de béns, és el dia 15 "
"del mes següent a l'inici del transport, o la data de la factura si és "
"anterior (art. 75.Uno.8.º). Sense `--operation-date`, la data de la "
"factura la substitueix. El Modelo 349 llegeix les factures estrictament "
"per aquesta data, sense arrossegar res de períodes anteriors."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:122
msgid "Link a catalogue invoice to a transaction"
msgstr "Vincula una factura del catàleg a una transacció"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:124
msgid ""
"Link a catalogue invoice to the bank transaction that paid or collected "
"it. The example starts with one bank transaction and one issued invoice, "
"links them, and confirms the link on the invoice:"
msgstr ""
"Vincula una factura del catàleg a la transacció bancària que la va pagar "
"o cobrar. L'exemple parteix d'una transacció bancària i una factura "
"emesa, les vincula i confirma el vincle a la factura:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:132
msgid ""
"Remove a catalogue invoice you created by mistake, confirming with "
"`--yes`. If the invoice is still linked to a transaction, the removal is "
"refused, so the bank transaction never ends up citing an invoice that no "
"longer exists. `aeat` has no command that unlinks an invoice. Removing "
"the linked transaction releases the link (see [Correct mistakes in your "
"ledger](correct-ledger-entries.md)). The example removes an invoice that "
"has no link:"
msgstr ""
"Elimina una factura del catàleg que hagis creat per error, confirmant amb"
" `--yes`. Si la factura encara està vinculada a una transacció, "
"l'eliminació es rebutja, de manera que la transacció bancària mai no "
"acaba citant una factura que ja no existeix. `aeat` no té cap ordre que "
"desvinculi una factura. Eliminar la transacció vinculada allibera el "
"vincle (consulta [Corregeix els errors del teu ledger](correct-ledger-"
"entries.md)). L'exemple elimina una factura que no té cap vincle:"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:143
msgid "Which modelos read your invoices"
msgstr "Quins modelos llegeixen les teves factures"

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:145
msgid ""
"Catalogue invoices feed **Modelo 349** (the recapitulative declaration of"
" intra-community operations) through the operation type you stamp on them"
" when you create them. This is the modelo your issued and received "
"invoices drive directly. Modelo 100 calculations also read the invoice "
"linked to an income or expense transaction, for example the withholding "
"declared on it."
msgstr ""
"Les factures del catàleg alimenten el **Modelo 349** (la declaració "
"recapitulativa d'operacions intracomunitàries) a través del tipus "
"d'operació que hi assignes quan les crees. Aquest és el modelo que les "
"teves factures emeses i rebudes alimenten directament. Els càlculs del "
"Modelo 100 també llegeixen la factura vinculada a una transacció d'ingrés"
" o de despesa, per exemple la retenció que hi consta."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:151
msgid ""
"Modelo 303 (quarterly IVA) and Modelo 390 (annual IVA summary) take their"
" amounts from your classified ledger, not from the invoice catalogue. "
"They do check the catalogue: if an invoice's IVA for the period exceeds "
"what the ledger carries, the calculation refuses until you record and "
"classify the matching transactions (see [Classify transactions](classify-"
"transactions.md)). Recording an invoice here does not add it to a Modelo "
"303."
msgstr ""
"El Modelo 303 (IVA trimestral) i el Modelo 390 (resum anual d'IVA) prenen"
" els seus imports del teu ledger classificat, no del catàleg de factures."
" Sí que comproven el catàleg: si l'IVA d'una factura per al període "
"supera el que porta el ledger, el càlcul es nega fins que registres i "
"classifiques les transaccions corresponents (consulta [Classifica les "
"transaccions](classify-transactions.md)). Registrar una factura aquí no "
"l'afegeix a un Modelo 303."

#: ../../how-to/manage-invoices.md:158
msgid ""
"Cross-border B2C sales under the One-Stop-Shop scheme (Modelo 369) are a "
"separate flow not yet reachable from `invoice add`; record those through "
"the OSS-specific workflow."
msgstr ""
"Les vendes transfrontereres B2C acollides al règim de finestreta única "
"(Modelo 369) segueixen un flux a part, encara no accessible des "
"d'`invoice add`; registra-les mitjançant el flux específic d'OSS."

